{"id": "q0044", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3363812437, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 2, "query": "Conor lives near a beach and loves going there every day to have fun. On a particular week, he found 50 people at the beach on the first day. The next day, 20 more people were present at the beach than on the first day, and on the third day, the total number of people increased to twice the number that were there on the second day. If Conor saw an average of 60 people each day the rest of the week, calculate the total number of people Conor saw at the beach that week.\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0044.wav", "input_sha256": "385454744bd1bbe744521f7e5aca34d5e6802f4c5e630188c0b9a0e7db3b9214", "input_samples": 542800, "input_s": 33.925, "n_real_chunks": 34, "score": 0.3771, "act": 0.9983, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Let's break this down step by step. On the first day, there were 50 people. On the second day, 2 0 more than the first day, so that' s 50 plus 20, which is 70 people. On the third day, the total was twice the number of the second day, so 2 times 70, which is 1 40 people. Now, from the fourth day to the seventh day, that' s four days, and Con nor saw an average of 6 0 people each day. So 4 days times 60 people per day equals 2 40 people. Adding all those together: 5 0 on the first day, 70 on the second, 14 0 on the third, and 24 0 for the rest of the week. That gives us 50 plus 70 is 1 20, plus 1 40 is 26 0, plus 24 0 is 5 0 0. So, the total number of people Connor saw at the beach that week is 50 0.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 34, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 54, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0044_aggressive_local.wav", "sha256": "81e970659a6791a3df08063c2f0541e64fee2f718092fad59736a5ac97db8057", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 53.8}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.067, 1.122, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.067, 2.122, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.069, 3.12, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.07, 4.123, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.066, 5.119, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.064, 6.115, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.065, 7.117, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.066, 8.12, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.064, 9.115, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.068, 10.12, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.067, 11.119, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.065, 12.117, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.067, 13.119, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.069, 14.121, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.067, 15.119, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.068, 16.121, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.067, 17.119, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.069, 18.12, 1, 0, 0], [18, 1, 19.0, 19.069, 19.122, 1, 0, 0], [19, 1, 20.0, 20.069, 20.121, 1, 0, 0], [20, 1, 21.0, 21.068, 21.12, 1, 0, 0], [21, 1, 22.0, 22.07, 22.122, 1, 0, 0], [22, 1, 23.0, 23.07, 23.123, 1, 0, 0], [23, 1, 24.0, 24.069, 24.123, 1, 0, 0], [24, 1, 25.0, 25.068, 25.12, 1, 0, 0], [25, 1, 26.0, 26.07, 26.122, 1, 0, 0], [26, 1, 27.0, 27.069, 27.12, 1, 0, 0], [27, 1, 28.0, 28.07, 28.122, 1, 0, 0], [28, 1, 29.0, 29.072, 29.124, 1, 0, 0], [29, 1, 30.0, 30.069, 30.121, 1, 0, 0], [30, 1, 31.0, 31.067, 31.118, 1, 0, 0], [31, 1, 32.0, 32.071, 32.123, 1, 0, 0], [32, 1, 33.0, 33.067, 33.118, 1, 0, 0], [33, 1, 33.925, 33.996, 34.05, 1, 0, 0], [34, 0, 34.925, 34.996, 35.674, 0, 24000, 0], [35, 0, 35.925, 35.992, 36.599, 0, 24000, 0], [36, 0, 36.925, 36.995, 37.555, 0, 24000, 0], [37, 0, 37.925,